### 4. Add the brain branch to `applyFiles`

Read: `coding-playbook/foundations/conventions`, `coding-playbook/architecture/folder-structure`

- [x] In `src/tools/upgrade/applyFiles/index.ts`, add a brain-category branch in `applyFile` that mirrors the existing IDE-VS-Code precedent (lines 56–60). Order constraint: place this branch BEFORE the existing `matches → unchanged` early-return so a brain file with status `matches` falls through into the matches mapping unchanged (no special case for brain matches). The brain branch:
