  Traced to: spec outcomes.desired bullet "The `brain` category is detection-only … apply mode never writes brain.aide; the manifest entry routes the agent to `/aide:brain config`"; spec outcomes.undesired bullet rejecting any apply path that scaffolds brain.aide from inside upgrade.

